1. IP geolocation data: DB-IP
-----------------------------

IP Geolocation by DB-IP (https://db-ip.com)

The enrichment service downloads the free DB-IP Lite city and ASN databases
at run time. No DB-IP data is included in this repository. DB-IP Lite is
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), which requires attribution to
DB-IP.com. DB-IP's terms also require a link back to https://db-ip.com on any
web page that displays or uses results from the database. The Version 1
dashboard does not display geolocation results. Any page that does must carry
the link: <a href='https://db-ip.com'>IP Geolocation by DB-IP</a>


