4. Threat-intelligence feeds and providers
------------------------------------------

The enrichment service downloads public feeds at run time, and no feed data is
included in this repository. The feeds are abuse.ch Feodo Tracker, Proofpoint
Emerging Threats compromised IPs, CINS Army, blocklist.de, Spamhaus DROP,
OpenPhish community feed, Phishing Army, the Tor Project exit list, and the
published AWS and Google Cloud address ranges. Optional providers (AbuseIPDB,
VirusTotal, AlienVault OTX, abuse.ch and CIRCL hashlookup) are off unless the
operator configures them with their own keys. Each feed and provider has its
own terms of use, including limits on commercial use for some of them, and
those terms apply to whoever runs this software.


